{"ts": 0.033337, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[90m─\u001b[0m \u001b[93mshelltutor\u001b[0m \u001b[90m─\u001b[0m \u001b[90mStage 4 · Commands, streams, composition\u001b[0m \u001b[90m──────────────\u001b[0m \u001b[90m○\u001b[0m\u001b[90m○\u001b[0m\u001b[90m○\u001b[0m\u001b[93m◉\u001b[0m\u001b[90m○\u001b[0m  \u001b[93m\u001b[0m \u001b[90m─\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n", "len": 237}
{"ts": 0.035192, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[1;97mSTAGE 4 — Commands, streams, composition\u001b[0m\r\nThree lessons, then a gate. You'll read a command's structure, check\r\nwhether a command exists, and chain commands together with pipes,\r\nredirects, and globs.\r\nCommands this stage:\r\n  \u001b[92mcommand -v\u001b[0m   ask the shell if a program is installed\r\n  \u001b[92mwc\u001b[0m           word, line, and character count\r\n  \u001b[92mseq\u001b[0m           generate number sequences\r\n  \u001b[92mhead\u001b[0m          first N lines of input\r\n  \u001b[92msort\u001b[0m          sort lines\r\n  \u001b[92mgrep\u001b[0m          select lines matching a pattern\r\n  \u001b[92m|\u001b[0m             \u001b[36mpipe\u001b[0m: send one command's output into the next\r\n  \u001b[92m>\u001b[0m             \u001b[36mredirect\u001b[0m: write output to a file (overwrites)\r\n  \u001b[92m>>\u001b[0m            \u001b[36mappend\u001b[0m: add output to the end of a file\r\n  \u001b[92m<\u001b[0m             \u001b[36minput redirect\u001b[0m: read a file into a command\r\n  \u001b[92m*\u001b[0m             \u001b[36mglob\u001b[0m: match many filenames at once\r\n\r\n\u001b[93m▶ Type \u001b[92mnext\u001b[93m to begin lesson 4.1.\u001b[0m\r\n", "len": 997}
{"ts": 0.035622, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n", "len": 251}
